{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive under overwhelming odds as hordes of enemies, random events and weather, boss fights, and explosive builds push your skills to the limit. Choose unique classes with powerful active abilities that define your playstyle \u2014 raise the dead as the Necromancer, or charge through relentless foes as the Knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/88ad2701721fd28080dce8e0a5457f43.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/88ad2701721fd28080dce8e0a5457f43.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/88ad2701721fd28080dce8e0a5457f43.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Unique Abilities That Fight For You\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/8603e6fd97481f76cbc25c81fe19ed1c.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=718 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/8603e6fd97481f76cbc25c81fe19ed1c.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/8603e6fd97481f76cbc25c81fe19ed1c.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each adventure in a level, you will be offered the opportunity to select from a variety of weaponry, magic, and traps to defeat your enemies, <strong>featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than twenty-five unique weapons, each with their own legendary upgrades and special rare upgrades - from explosive Dynamite to chilling Ice Spikes to summoning a Laser Eye to incinerate your enemies!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than one hundred unique meta-progression upgrades - ranging from Electrically Charged Turrets, making yourself a rage-induced Barbarian, to calling purifying light down from the heavens!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/4efc2614345f87453283d24a33ad0d94.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/4efc2614345f87453283d24a33ad0d94.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/4efc2614345f87453283d24a33ad0d94.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine unique classes, each with their own progression trees - play as a Barbarian, a Warrior, a Mage, or even a Frog!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/82626e55642e61f078485670d89c1965.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=518 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/82626e55642e61f078485670d89c1965.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/82626e55642e61f078485670d89c1965.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Battle in Unique Locations and Fight a Variety of Monsters\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the campaign mode, completing objectives to uncover the mystery of the island you are on, to an endless mode where you battle until the enemies overwhelm you to achieve the highest survival time, there is endless content to keep you engaged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/7d715ff1de568efa56a4dbd23f937c9b.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/7d715ff1de568efa56a4dbd23f937c9b.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/7d715ff1de568efa56a4dbd23f937c9b.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique biomes, with eight different Locations within the Biomes, one for Endless and one for Survival each! Traverse through a forest, a deadly trap-filled dungeon, sandy island beach, and the fiery pits of a volcano!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than fifty different types of enemies - from Rats to Ghouls to Wizards and Floating Skulls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than six unique Bosses to overcome, with plenty of Unique Elite enemies to encounter along the way!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to higher difficulties after completing the game, providing even more challenge with additional objectives, new enemies, and greater the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think you're the best? Compete in the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each biome contains an Endless map variant, where you can</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for rank 1 on the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out what other players are building, maybe learn some new strategies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive as long as possible, activating unique<strong> Shrines</strong> and fighting an endless amount of bosses and enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/c9a32f395826519246afd3e356cd9b17.avif?t=1772211649\" width=1560 height=836 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It doesn't always have to be violent...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take a break from the fighting, and enjoy some minigames at your hub!</strong> Take part in blacksmithing - improve your equipment for your next battles or be adventurous and try to catch your own fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=1064 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.webm?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.mp4?t=1772211649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 5!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/8ceefa75a35d4c5467fa82fcba3319cdc9c1f28f.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/e5f51c4369a85f3f6324a6d9d2a93dac36debc3c.jpg"},{"name":"Level 15!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/1ffcecfe27a9c8b03935b595e5cfb3e81b858883.jpg"},{"name":"Class Unlock: Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/78bb4d8d3679c3de36a0eaf6065cb0d2de2a385c.jpg"},{"name":"Class Unlock: Barbarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/130763b53671bdd21b5835a2468ae55b241245ca.jpg"},{"name":"Class Unlock: Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/7fa03d16bd08f9fbe5525f2142aacf8d90928892.jpg"},{"name":"Class Unlock: Necromancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/a6dd9f2514a9519edfc00ec4e77bcdde6bab3412.jpg"},{"name":"Class Unlock: Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/6091c61ca9321d3f67774c81ffb3f7417ececc70.jpg"},{"name":"Level Complete: Grasslands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/58a0eb522f9184083c1c85795b3cc7b411a145d4.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Acquired!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629280/90860347d8541ea5fd91e27351594d329c3c09b2.jpg"}],"total":62},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629280?t=1772211649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/d91241e4a2aaa2497de92f1b07a9342926f9c462/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772211649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772211649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772211649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3720490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive under overwhelming odds as hordes of enemies, random events and weather, boss fights, and explosive builds push your skills to the limit. Choose unique classes with powerful active abilities that define your playstyle \u2014 raise the dead as the Necromancer, or charge through relentless foes as the Knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/88ad2701721fd28080dce8e0a5457f43.poster.avif?t=1772211649\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams